IMPORT prelude
IMPORT daydate
IMPORT `aia-core`
IMPORT `aia-timeline`
IMPORT `P3-section-3`
IMPORT `P3-art-16`

-- Tests of Article 16 (providers of high-risk AI systems). Expected values are written from the text of Article 16, line by line, before the run.
-- Chapter III Sections 1 to 3 apply to an Annex III system from 2 December 2027 (Art 113(c)(i)): the day before, every function answers NOTHING.
-- args: date asked, the AI system, the circumstances, then the facts of the point.

§ `Fixtures`

`P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 12 December 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 12 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex III system to be placed 2 December 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 8 2028
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(1) and Annex I`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 1 1 2027
    `route` IS `Route Article 6(2) and Annex III`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS TRUE

`P3 system that is not high-risk` MEANS `AI system` WITH
    `date placed on the market or put into service` IS Date 2 12 2027
    `route` IS `Route neither`
    `significantly changed in its design since the date of application of Chapter III` IS FALSE

`P3 plain circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 Section B circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS TRUE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS FALSE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS FALSE

`P3 equivalent protection circumstances` MEANS `Section 3 circumstances` WITH
    `related to Section B products` IS FALSE
    `Section A equivalent protection` IS TRUE
    `no reduction of the overall level of protection` IS TRUE




§ `Article 16(a): ensure compliance with the requirements of Section 2`

-- (a) the system complies: met. It does not: the flat "shall" is not done. The day before the date of application: not covered.
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
-- Art 2(2): an Article 6(1) system with Section B products is cut off from Article 16 from 2 August 2028 (the keel's answer is a flat "only ... shall apply").
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 Section B circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 8 2028) `P3 Annex I system placed 2 August 2028` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Art 111(2): a legacy system not significantly changed is saved (NOTHING); once significantly changed the Article applies.
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 legacy Annex III system placed 1 January 2027 and changed` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Not a high-risk system: no date under Chapter III Sections 1 to 3.
#ASSERT `Art 16(a) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system is compliant with the requirements set out in Section 2` (Date 2 12 2030) `P3 system that is not high-risk` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 16(b): name and contact address on the system, or where not possible on its packaging or documentation`

-- args: indicated on the system; not possible to indicate on the system; indicated on packaging or accompanying documentation
#ASSERT `Art 16(b) the provider has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark and its contact address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(b) the provider has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark and its contact address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
-- Packaging alone does not do where indication on the system was possible.
#ASSERT `Art 16(b) the provider has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark and its contact address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE TRUE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(b) the provider has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark and its contact address` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(b) the provider has indicated its name, registered trade name or registered trade mark and its contact address` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 16(c), (d): the quality management system and the documentation`

#ASSERT `Art 16(c) the provider has a quality management system in place which complies with Article 17` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(c) the provider has a quality management system in place which complies with Article 17` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(c) the provider has a quality management system in place which complies with Article 17` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 16(d) the provider keeps the documentation referred to in Article 18` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(d) the provider keeps the documentation referred to in Article 18` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(d) the provider keeps the documentation referred to in Article 18` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 16(e): the logs "when under their control"`

-- args: the logs are under the provider's control; the provider keeps them
#ASSERT `Art 16(e) the provider keeps the logs automatically generated by its high-risk AI system when under its control` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(e) the provider keeps the logs automatically generated by its high-risk AI system when under its control` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- Logs not under its control: the point does not speak, whether or not they are kept (NOTHING-kind: limited by its own wording).
#ASSERT `Art 16(e) the provider keeps the logs automatically generated by its high-risk AI system when under its control` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE FALSE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 16(e) the provider keeps the logs automatically generated by its high-risk AI system when under its control` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `Art 16(e) the provider keeps the logs automatically generated by its high-risk AI system when under its control` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

§ `Article 16(f): conformity assessment prior to placing on the market (seam S6)`

#ASSERT `Art 16(f) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system undergoes the relevant conformity assessment procedure` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(f) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system undergoes the relevant conformity assessment procedure` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
#ASSERT `Art 16(f) the provider has ensured that the high-risk AI system undergoes the relevant conformity assessment procedure` (Date 1 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS NOTHING

