§ `Article 16(j), (k), (l): corrective actions, demonstrating conformity upon a reasoned request, accessibility`

#ASSERT `Art 16(j) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions and provided information as required in Article 20` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `Art 16(j) the provider has taken the necessary corrective actions and provided information as required in Article 20` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
