#ASSERT `Art 16(k) the provider has demonstrated the conformity of the high-risk AI system upon a reasoned request` (Date 2 12 2027) `P3 Annex III system placed 2 December 2027` `P3 plain circumstances` TRUE FALSE EQUALS JUST FALSE
-- No request: the duty is not triggered (NOTHING-kind: limited by its own wording "upon a reasoned request").
